@startuml AnalytiCore_Deployment_Component
title AnalytiCore Note App — Component & Deployment View (Prototype)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50

actor "Local User\n(single workstation)" as User

node "Developer / Demo Host (loopback)" as Host {

  node "Web Browser\n(ES2022+)" as Browser {
    component [AnalytiCore SPA\nReact + TypeScript + Vite] as SPA {
      component [UI Shell\nApp, Sidebar, Pages] as UI
      component [AgentChatbox] as Chat
      component [Document Ingestion\n(pdfjs extract + keyword retrieve)] as Ingest
      component [Analytics\n(dataset + retail + Recharts)] as Analytics
      component [Document Storage Client\n(/api fetch)] as StorageClient
    }
    component [ollama/browser SDK] as OllamaSDK
    component [Legacy IndexedDB\n(migration only)] as IDB
  }

  node "Node.js Runtime" as NodeRuntime {
    component [Express Document API\nserver/index.mjs\n127.0.0.1:3002] as API {
      component [Multer upload\nvalidation] as Multer
      component [Schema init\n+ CRUD handlers] as Handlers
    }
  }

  node "Vite Dev Server\n(dev only)\n127.0.0.1:3000" as Vite <<optional>> {
    component [React HMR + /api proxy\n→ 127.0.0.1:3002] as Proxy
  }

  node "Docker / Colima" as Docker {
    database "MySQL 8.4\n127.0.0.1:3307\n(documents, document_chunks)" as MySQL
  }

  node "Ollama Service\n(host process, not in compose)" as OllamaHost {
    component [Llama 3 / selected model\n:11434 default] as Llama
  }
}

User --> Browser : HTTPS/HTTP UI\nhttp://127.0.0.1:3000 (dev)\nor :3002 (prod static)
UI --> Chat
UI --> Analytics
UI --> StorageClient
Chat --> Ingest : searchDocuments()
Chat --> OllamaSDK : chat()
Analytics --> Ingest : structured text from docs
StorageClient --> IDB : migrate legacy uploads\non startup (if present)

' Dev path
Vite -[hidden]-> Browser
Proxy ..> API : proxy /api/*
StorageClient --> Proxy : /api/* (dev)
Proxy --> API

' Prod path (same host, API serves dist/)
StorageClient --> API : /api/* (prod,\nsame origin :3002)

API --> Multer
API --> Handlers
Handlers --> MySQL : mysql2 pool\nparameterized SQL

OllamaSDK --> Llama : HTTP OpenAI-compatible\nOllama API\n(host/model from ApiConfig)

note right of Vite
  **Dev execution**
  npm run dev =
  concurrently api + web
  Browser talks to Vite :3000;
  /api proxied to API :3002.
end note

note right of API
  **Prod execution**
  npm run build && npm start
  Express serves dist/ SPA
  and /api on :3002 only.
  Vite node is absent.
end note

note bottom of Llama
  **Emerging technology**
  Local generative LLM.
  Not Dockerised by this
  project; must be started
  separately (ollama serve).
end note

note bottom of MySQL
  Only container defined in
  docker-compose.yml.
  Bound to loopback.
end note

@enduml
